      "The keeper who notes a gale works on Wednesday.",
      "Perpetua notes thunder.",
      "Lucian notes drizzle.",
      "The keeper who notes drizzle does not work on Tuesday.",
      "Hollis and Wednesday are exactly one day apart in day order, in one direction or the other.",
      "Wednesday is exactly one day earlier than the keeper who notes sea fog, with no day in between."
